flowchart LR
  Reasoner[Reasoner: validated Plan] --> Executor[Executor: RAG, catalog, tools]
  Executor --> Gates[Deterministic Rx, confirmation, safety gates]
  Gates --> Evidence[Grounded evidence: SQL + RAG + conversation memory]
  Evidence --> Synthesizer[Synthesizer: LLM response]
  Synthesizer --> Fallback[Deterministic fallback if LLM unavailable]
  Fallback --> Guardrail
  Synthesizer --> Guardrail[Final safety guardrail]
